<title>UK: OPEC board of governors meets in Vienna - OPECNA.</title>
<headline>OPEC board of governors meets in Vienna - OPECNA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC's board of governors began meeting at the group's secretariat in Vienna on Tuesday, ahead of the full ministerial meeting on June 25, the OPEC news agency OPECNA said.</p>
<p>The board considers the agenda for the full meeting.</p>
<p>Chaired by Iraqi governor Saddam Zabin Hassan, the board is scheduled to review oil market developments, and discuss the preliminary draft budget of 1998 and the secretariat's provisional work programme for next year, OPECNA said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7629</p>
